# redshift_masking_policy_attachments (Data Source)

Lists which masking policies are attached to which columns for which users, roles, or `PUBLIC` in one database, with
their input columns and priorities, including attachments Terraform does not manage. See AWS
[SVV_ATTACHED_MASKING_POLICY](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SVV_ATTACHED_MASKING_POLICY.html).

